      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, left side",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>I bought safflower (\u02bfu\u1e63fur): 5 qin\u1e6d\u0101rs at the price of</li>\n<li>29 dinars per qin\u1e6d\u0101r &mdash; the total price:&nbsp;145 dinars</li>\n<li>Expenses from it: wrapping cloths, a sack, rope, and thread,</li>\n<li>two bindings &mdash; 8 d\u0101niqs and 2 dirhams &mdash; and a gratuity,</li>\n<li>porters and sundries: 12 dirhams. That [ ] total:</li>\n<li>154 dinars, 6 dirhams</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
