        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, right side",
          "value": "\n\n<ol><li>What I have aboard a ship: [8?] [ ] &mdash; 3 bales</li>\n<li>of copper, and a bale of al-q\u0101rib [ ] &mdash; 2 loads. The freight:</li>\n<li>2&frac12; mithq\u0101ls. Also a bale of silk,</li>\n<li>containing [ ] silk and a bag of dyed goods,</li>\n<li>and 2 bundles for \u02bfA\u1e6d\u012bq, and a large cloth/carpet &mdash;</li>\n<li>reckoned at half a load: freight 1&frac14; mithq\u0101ls.</li>\n<li>He received from that 10 d\u0101niqs, which equals 2 mithq\u0101ls &mdash;</li>\n<li>leaving owed to me 1&frac14; mithq\u0101ls, which he should pay</li>\n<li>to him. \u02bfA\u1e6d\u012bq [ ] &mdash; I paid it to him.</li>\n<li>I also have, in the hands of \u02bfAmr\u0101n the Sicilian, a bale containing</li>\n<li>[ ] and a box of coral &mdash; from which \u02bfAmr\u0101n gets</li>\n<li>4 Byzantine coins, and the [ ] is his, and the rest is mine. I paid</li>\n<li>for the expenses of the bale &mdash; porterage and gratuity &mdash; 4 dirhams.</li></ol>\n\n",
